## UI polish: Notification settings card

13 fixes across Spacing, Typography, Contrast, Hierarchy and States. Text and brand hue kept.

### Fixes
1. **Spacing**: `padding: 13px` on the card is off the scale. Now `padding: 12px`. (R-ui-polish-1)
2. **Spacing**: `margin: 0 0 5px` on the heading is off the scale. Now `margin: 0 0 4px`. (R-ui-polish-1)
3. **Spacing**: `padding: 6px 10px` on both buttons is off the scale. Now `padding: 8px 12px`. (R-ui-polish-1)
4. **Typography**: `font-size: 22px` on the heading is off the scale. Now `font-size: 24px`. (R-ui-polish-2)
5. **Typography**: `font-size: 13px` on the description is off the scale and below the 16 px body minimum. Now `font-size: 16px`. (R-ui-polish-2)
6. **Typography**: the buttons used the browser default size (about 13.33px) and font. Now `font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px`. (R-ui-polish-2)
7. **Typography**: the heading had the browser default `line-height: normal`. Now `line-height: 1.25`. (R-ui-polish-3)
8. **Typography**: the description had `line-height: normal` and no width limit. Now `line-height: 1.5; max-width: 65ch`. (R-ui-polish-3)
9. **Contrast**: `#aaaaaa` on `#ffffff` is 2.32:1. Now `#747474` (same neutral grey, darker), 4.67:1. (R-ui-polish-4)
10. **Hierarchy**: "Save changes" and "Cancel" were both filled `#2563eb`, so there were two primary actions. "Save changes" stays filled. "Cancel" is now an outline button: `background: #ffffff; color: #2563eb; border: 1px solid #2563eb`. (R-ui-polish-5)
11. **States**: the buttons had no hover style. Now the primary hover is `background: #1d4ed8` and the secondary hover is `background: #eff6ff; color: #1d4ed8; border-color: #1d4ed8`. (R-ui-polish-6)
12. **States**: the buttons had no focus or disabled style. Now `:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: 2px }` and `:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed }`. (R-ui-polish-6)
13. **States**: the buttons were about 30px tall, below the 44 px target. Now `min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px`. (R-ui-polish-7)

